  "details": "Description\n\nGestures have been weird lately. The gestures does not come out most of the time when making the appropriate motion. this bug continues throughout avatar change. sometimes it works on the right hand only, then randomly stops working only for the left controller gestures to work instead. i've attempted to switch to various bindings in steam with no change in behaviour. i attempted to replicate this issue in vrchat steam frame standalone and that works. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\ntbh... i don't know how to reproduce this. get in any avatar on steam frame using remote play and attempt to use gesture\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p3-1939-4803d92ede-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-20_21-24-29.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_37fed3ea-f1f4-4d35-bd1a-86c215f2a46d/1/file)",
